- R14 falsifier: `falsifier.tier_1` (refutes class) vs `tier_2` (refutes strengthening only); witness_type; machine_checkable_steps list; explicit `genericity_witness_requirement` for tier-1; and for SCC the falsifier must be an *extension* witness (not a visible singularity).
